cess the bespoke lifestyle at comfortable homes and world-class amenities within this artfully derived architectural masterpiece.\n\nThis 42-storey rising cornerstone is the premium living benchmark of the community. With innovative detailing and subtly carved sophistication, it’s a branded gem that adorns the open skyline amidst the lush landscapes of the community.","score":0.8235701,"raw_content":null,"id":"543ded-05"}],"response_time":0.0,"request_id":"e0c0e0ce-d061-468a-84de-2a3e6af4a640"}